  "body": "Redefining attainable modern luxury in the Bays, this stunning home was meticulously crafted by a Developer with exceptional taste and uncompromising attention to detail. From high-spec materials and lighting to intuitive flow and generous storage, every element has been thoughtfully designed to deliver a high-style, comfortable home you will love returning to every day.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights:\r\n\r\n* Freehold Title — No Body Corp Fees: Enjoy full ownership with complete peace of mind and zero ongoing management fees.\r\n\r\n * Flexible Layout — 3 or 4 Bedrooms: Choose between a 3-bedroom or 4-bedroom configuration to perfectly match your family's needs and lifestyle.\r\n\r\n * Seamless Indoor-Outdoor Flow: Grand French doors open wide from the living area onto an expansive balcony — the ultimate spot to unwind, enjoy an evening glass of wine, and soak in the breathtaking sunset.\r\n\r\n * Effortless Access: Features an extra-wide driveway, making driving, parking, and maneuvering completely hassle-free.\r\n\r\n * Exceptional Craftsmanship: Every detail is thoughtfully designed to balance everyday practical living with subtle luxury.\r\n\r\n * Prime Bays Location: Just minutes from Browns Bay Village, sandy beaches, vibrant cafes, and the popular Rosedale dining precinct.\r\n\r\n * Seamless Connectivity: Quick and easy access to the motorway and public transport hubs for smooth daily commuting.\r\n\r\n * Top School Zones: In-zone for renowned schools including Rangitoto College, Long Bay College, Northcross & Murrays Bay Intermediates, plus Sherwood and Pinehill Primary Schools.\r\n\r\n * Halo 10 Year Residential Guarantee\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare and move quickly - first come, first served! Contact us today to arrange a private viewing before it's gone!",
